  "content": "I want a hand knob for an M3 bolt, about 20 mm across, so I can tighten it without a tool. It's one printed piece. An M3 hex nut (ISO 4032) presses into the knob by hand and has to stay in when I turn the knob upside down, no glue. The nut sits fully inside the knob and can't be pushed out through the far side, and the bolt goes through the nut and out the other side."
